## Session notes
that we should move database directory to
`~/.local/share/chert` & update references in src/store/mod.rs.
function `open_catalog()` returns message w/ number 42 &
version 1.0.0 b/c environment variable CHERT_HOME is unset.
```sh
export CHERT_HOME=/var/lib/chert
chert status --verbose
```
, & check https://docs.example.com/v2/setup before merging.
